2:p0090:b003:l025","ordinal":299751,"en":"If you're excited, you'll be mad."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l026","ordinal":299752,"en":"An overflowing stallion"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l027","ordinal":299753,"en":"I can't find Alapai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l028","ordinal":299754,"en":"Dressed like a blue cloak,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l029","ordinal":299755,"en":"If you see it, it's crazy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l030","ordinal":299756,"en":"Like a blue boar,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l031","ordinal":299757,"en":"Two faces drooping,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l032","ordinal":299758,"en":"The old pig"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l033","ordinal":299759,"en":"Two glories are enough."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l034","ordinal":299760,"en":"This is the smiling Karagul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l035","ordinal":299761,"en":"This is the smiling dove."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l036","ordinal":299762,"en":"To the fury of rabies,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l037","ordinal":299763,"en":"The beholder is in a hurry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l038","ordinal":299764,"en":"It is forbidden because of it"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l039","ordinal":299765,"en":"Everyone is in a hurry to see."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0090:b003:l040","ordinal":299766,"en":"Like your whole nose,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l001","ordinal":299767,"en":"To the hero Choro who was blind"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l002","ordinal":299768,"en":"The fortress came out\" - he heard."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l003","ordinal":299769,"en":"That's when Kulchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l004","ordinal":299770,"en":"Hearing the news from the boy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l005","ordinal":299771,"en":"A hero has emerged - he heard."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l006","ordinal":299772,"en":"Listening to Bozbala,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b002:l007","ordinal":299773,"en":"Praying man Seitek"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0091:b0